<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050b13">
  <title>EMS — Личный кабинет</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo-premium.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/portal-theme.css?v=20260808-v6-1">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <a class="side-brand" href="/dashboard">
        <img src="/images/logo-premium.svg" alt="">
        <span>
          <b>EAST LOS SANTOS</b>
          <strong>HOSPITAL</strong>
          <small>EMS | MAJESTIC RP</small>
        </span>
      </a>

      <nav class="side-nav">
        <a class="nav-item active" href="/dashboard">
          <span class="nav-ico">⌂</span><span>Главная</span>
        </a>

        <a class="nav-item" href="/profile">
          <span class="nav-ico">◉</span><span>Мой профиль</span>
        </a>

        <% if ((permissions || []).includes("control.access")) { %>
        <a class="nav-item pulse-control-nav" href="/control">
          <span class="nav-ico">◆</span><span>Pulse Control</span>
        </a>
        <% } %>

        <div class="nav-section">КАДРОВЫЕ СЕРВИСЫ</div>

        <a class="nav-item" href="/forms/vacation-ooc"><span class="nav-ico">▣</span><span>Отпуска</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="/forms/promotion"><span class="nav-ico">↗</span><span>Карьера</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="/forms/weekly-report"><span class="nav-ico">▤</span><span>Отчётность</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="/forms/staff-department-transfer"><span class="nav-ico">⇄</span><span>Переводы</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="/forms/blacklist"><span class="nav-ico">◈</span><span>Контроль</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="/forms/department-transfer"><span class="nav-ico">♟</span><span>Отделы</span></a>
      </nav>

      <div class="support-card">
        <div class="support-icon">⌁</div>
        <strong>Техническая поддержка</strong>
        <p>Если возникли проблемы с порталом, обратитесь к администрации EMS.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="main-area">
      <main class="content">
        <section class="welcome-banner">
          <div class="welcome-copy">
            <span class="welcome-kicker">EMS PERSONNEL SYSTEM</span>
            <p class="welcome-small">Добро пожаловать,</p>
            <h1><%= user.global_name || user.username %> <span class="verified">✓</span></h1>

            <div class="identity-row">
              <div class="identity-chip">
                <span class="chip-icon">◉</span>
                <span>Discord: <b><%= user.username %></b></span>
              </div>
              <div class="identity-chip online"><i></i>Онлайн</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="banner-actions">
            <a class="header-button site" href="https://emsmajestic.ru" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span>◎</span> Официальный сайт
            </a>
            <a class="header-button logout" href="/auth/logout">
              <span>⇥</span> Выйти
            </a>
          </div>

          <img class="banner-art" src="/images/ems-command-hero.svg" alt="East Los Santos Hospital">
        </section>

        <section class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="section-title-row">
              <span class="dot-grid">⠿</span>
              <h2>Кадровые сервисы</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Все внутренние заявления и запросы собраны в одном кабинете.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-count">
            <span class="count-icon">▣</span>
            <strong>9</strong>
            <small>доступных сервисов</small>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="services-grid">
          <a class="service-card blue" href="/forms/vacation-ooc">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-ooc.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>OOC-отпуск</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">ОТПУСК</span>
                </div>
                <p>Заявление на отпуск по причинам вне игрового процесса.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card green" href="/forms/vacation-ic">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-ic.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>IC-отпуск</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">ОТПУСК</span>
                </div>
                <p>Заявление на отпуск по внутриигровой причине.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card orange" href="/auth/resignation">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-out.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Увольнение</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">КАДРЫ</span>
                </div>
                <p>Заявление на увольнение из Emergency Medical Services.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card purple" href="/forms/break">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-break.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Перерыв</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">СЛУЖБА</span>
                </div>
                <p>Оформление временного перерыва сотрудника EMS.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card gold" href="/forms/promotion">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-up.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Запрос на повышение</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">КАРЬЕРА</span>
                </div>
                <p>Заявление на рассмотрение повышения сотрудника.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card blue2" href="/forms/weekly-report">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-weekly.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Недельный отчёт</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">ОТЧЁТНОСТЬ</span>
                </div>
                <p>Отчёт о работе сотрудника EMS за прошедшую неделю.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ЗАПОЛНИТЬ ОТЧЁТ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card cyan" href="/forms/staff-department-transfer">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-transfer.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Служебный перевод</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">ПЕРЕВОДЫ</span>
                </div>
                <p>Перевод сотрудника между подразделениями.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card pink" href="/forms/department-transfer">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-department.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Заявка в отдел</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">ОТДЕЛЫ</span>
                </div>
                <p>Подача заявки на перевод в выбранный отдел EMS.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a class="service-card red" href="/forms/blacklist">
            <div class="service-card-main">
              <div class="service-visual">
                <div class="service-icon-ring"><img src="/images/service-blacklist.svg" alt=""></div>
              </div>
              <div class="service-copy">
                <div class="service-head">
                  <h3>Чёрный список</h3>
                  <span class="service-badge">КОНТРОЛЬ</span>
                </div>
                <p>Запрос на добавление сотрудника в чёрный список EMS.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-footer">
              <strong>ОТКРЫТЬ ФОРМУ</strong><span class="service-arrow">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
